  hoursRangeError: ["Opening hours must satisfy 0 ≤ open < close ≤ 24", "영업시간은 0 ≤ 개점 < 폐점 ≤ 24를 만족해야 합니다", "营业时间须满足 0 ≤ 开门 < 关门 ≤ 24", "営業時間は 0 ≤ 開店 < 閉店 ≤ 24 にしてください", "El horario debe cumplir 0 ≤ apertura < cierre ≤ 24", "Les horaires doivent respecter 0 ≤ ouverture < fermeture ≤ 24"],
